ng", "id": "469772942639317", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75245824_469772945972650_8645358418190768821_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jZBKadYHAb8Q7kNvwFjash9&_nc_oc=AdqUMn94GtL7FsmNfE6q3eCLEt6XuoMGsF6lk_5WE4b9DESOG8RQxrjEVdKen0faiXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQTuCtn4krVxsaZq8dJZwXSMKjVs57XxudYJcyE3loWgA&oe=6AFC908E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scary Monkeys", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to scary monkeys, a harrowing Gorilla Tag fan game set within the decaying corridors of an abandoned factory. In this spine-chilling labyrinth of rusted metal and crumbling concrete, players must navigate the treacherous terrain while evading the relentless pursuit of a monstrous gorilla. As you delve deeper into the industrial abyss, uncovering cryptic clues and battling primal terror, every shadow becomes a potential threat and every moment a fight for survival. Will you emerge victorious from the heart of darkness, or will you succumb to the primal rage that lurks within the factory's grim confines?", "short_description": "Welcome to the eerie depths of scary monkeys, a spine-chilling Gorilla Tag fan game set within the dilapidated confines of an abandoned factory. Within these rusting corridors and dimly-lit chambers, players are thrust into a heart-pounding game of survival, pursued by a monstrous gorilla whose primal rage knows no bounds. As you navigate the labyrinthine machinery and claustrophobic spaces, you must outmaneuver the relentless beast while unraveling the dark secrets hidden within the factory'"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scarymonkeys/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ahoy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scarymonkeys/home", "category": null, "comfo